# 10. INPUT DATA
# ==========================================================
#
# IMPORTANT CHANGE:
#
# OLD:
#   document -> collect_list(all targets)
#
# NEW:
#   ONE ROW = ONE HYPERLINK OCCURRENCE
#
# Therefore the LLM sees the local context for each hyperlink.
#
